config VIDEO_KRAY_ADV7180
	tristate "ADV7180/ADV7282-M video decoder support (Kray-SoM-RKC)"
	depends on GPIOLIB && VIDEO_DEV && I2C
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
	help
	  The kernel's adv7180 driver with the link frequency control and the
	  progressive default the Rockchip CSI-2 D-PHY and ISP need, for the
	  ADV7282-M analogue video (CVBS) to MIPI CSI-2 decoder.

	  The module is called kray_adv7180.
